# Generated
# Note: crates/rdesk_common/src/protos/mod.rs is hand-written and MUST be
# tracked. prost-build writes the generated protobuf code to OUT_DIR, which
# lives under /target/; that module only include!()s it. Ignoring it here broke
# every fresh clone with "file not found for module `protos`".
